@HostAddress = http://localhost:5183

### 1. Crear Perfil de Cliente (Requisito 1)
# @name createCustomer
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Hermant Gabriel Diaz Guadamuz",
  "dateOfBirth": "1998-05-15",
  "gender": "Masculino",
  "monthlyIncome": 3500.00
}

###

### Variable para reutilizar el ID del cliente recién creado
@customerId = {{createCustomer.response.body.id}}

### 2. Crear Cuenta Bancaria con Depósito Inicial (Requisito 2)
# @name createAccount
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "initialDeposit": 1000.00
}

###

### Variable para reutilizar el número de cuenta generado
@accountNumber = {{createAccount.response.body.accountNumber}}

### 3. Consultar Saldo Actual (Requisito 3)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{accountNumber}}/balance
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Registrar Depósito (Requisito 4)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{accountNumber}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.00
}

###

### 5. Registrar Retiro Exitoso (Requisito 4)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{accountNumber}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 300.00
}

###

### 6. Registrar Retiro Rechazado por Fondos Insuficientes (Requisito 4 - RFC 7807)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{accountNumber}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 99999.00
}

###

### 7. Consultar Historial Cronológico de Transacciones (Requisito 5)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{accountNumber}}/history
Accept: application/json
